  "details": "On the latest Open Beta (build 1261), some worlds may completely break. \nYou'll load into a world, be greeted with nothing but black & some static, then be sent to the default home world. For other users, it looks like it may just be loading in, then sent back to the default home world. Clearing the world cache did not fix this issue.\nHere is a video of it happening with Downpour at Night (wrld_215dcdfb-dd1b-4538-a4d6-f8d62c82bd74): https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1045154763559419954/2022-11-23_19-49-11.mp4",
